   "Atlas/Rudvalis/CoupleFourTransitivity.lean:3:0: The module doc-string for a file should be the first command after the imports.\nPlease, add a module doc-string before `theorem fourCouple_shell_transitive (v w : fourShellPiece)\n    (hv : ReferenceCoupleOrthogonal (minimalCross v.val)) (hw : ReferenceCoupleOrthogonal (minimalCross w.val))\n    (he : coordinateRowEnergy referenceDozenRows v.val.val.val = coordinateRowEnergy referenceDozenRows w.val.val.val) :\n    ∃ g : codeGroup,\n      g • localReferenceCross = localReferenceCross ∧\n        g • referenceSecondCross = referenceSecondCross ∧ g • v.val = w.val :=\n  by\n  obtain ⟨a, ha⟩ := v.prop\n  obtain ⟨b, hb⟩ := w.prop\n  rw [← ha] at hv\n  rw [← hb] at hw\n  have hav := hv.1\n  have hbw := hw.1\n  rw [localReferenceCross_eq, fourWord_coordinate_orthogonal_iff] at hav hbw\n  obtain ⟨i, m, him⟩ := fourCouple_word_parameters a hav\n  obtain ⟨j, n, hjn⟩ := fourCouple_word_parameters b hbw\n  have he' : (if i = 0 then (0 : ℚ) else 2) = (if j = 0 then (0 : ℚ) else 2) :=\n    by\n    rw [← ha, ← hb, fourCouple_parameter_energy a i m him, fourCouple_parameter_energy b j n hjn] at he\n    exact he\n  have hij : i = 0 ↔ j = 0 := by by_cases hi : i = 0 <;> by_cases hj : j = 0 <;> simp_all\n  obtain ⟨g, hgx, hgy, hg⟩ :=\n    fourCouple_same_class_words i j m n hij a.val.val b.val.val a.val.prop b.val.prop a.prop.1 b.prop.1 him hjn\n  refine ⟨g, hgx, hgy, ?_⟩\n  rw [← ha, ← hb, ← minimumWordShellLift_equivariant]\n  apply congrArg minimumWordShellLift\n  exact Subtype.ext (Subtype.ext hg)`.\n\nNote: This linter can be disabled with `set_option linter.style.header false`",
